@startuml F17-loyalty-issuance
title F17 — Parcours client Yasmine : wizard → ThankYou → carte FG-…

actor "Yasmine\n(visiteuse)" as Y
participant "Wizard /kit" as W
participant "LeadCaptureStep" as L
participant "AddressStep" as A
participant "API /checkout/*" as API
participant "issueGrant\n+ computeActivatesAt" as ISS
participant "ThankYouStep\n+ LoyaltyCodeCard" as T
database "DB\norders / coupon_grants" as DB

note over API: PRÉCONDITION : template post_purchase ACTIF (seed-coupons.ts)

== Étape lead ==
Y -> L: firstName=Yasmine, phone=unique, consent
Y -> L: submit (wizard-lead-submit)
L -> API: PATCH /api/checkout/lead
API --> W: lead ok → goToStep('address')

== Étape adresse ==
Y -> A: ville (listbox → Casablanca), addressLine1
Y -> A: submit (wizard-address-submit)
A -> API: PATCH address
A -> API: PATCH payment(cod)
A -> API: POST /api/checkout/order\n{expectedTotalCents, couponCode?}
API -> DB: create order
API -> ISS: issueGrant(template, phone, sourceOrderId)
ISS -> ISS: activatesAt = orderDate + maxDeliveryDays(eta) + 1j
ISS -> DB: insert coupon_grant (code FG-…)
ISS --> API: { code, valueCents, activatesAt }
API --> A: { orderId, status, loyalty:{...} }
A -> A: setLoyalty(res.loyalty)
A -> W: goToStep('thank_you')

== Écran remerciement ==
W -> T: render step thank_you (DOM testid = wizard-step-thankyou)
T --> Y: wizard-thankyou-orderref (réf commande)
T --> Y: LoyaltyCodeCard\n• loyalty-code-value = FG-…-NNNN\n• valeur 20 MAD (terracotta)\n• « Utilisable à partir du <date> · valable 60 jours »\n• AUCUN numéro en clair (INV-PII)

@enduml
